          "In production service mesh deployments, security teams mandate SPIFFE-based workload attestation, verifying container image hashes and namespace signatures before issuing X.509 cryptographic identities.",
          "Short-lived certificates drastically reduce exposure windows if a private key is inadvertently leaked in heap dumps or debug logs, ensuring compromised keys expire within hours."
